    <div class="guidelines-notice"><span aria-hidden="true">ⓘ</span><p><strong>Our shared standard:</strong> Treat people fairly, represent items honestly, protect personal information, and report behavior that puts the community at risk. These guidelines apply to listings, messages, and other activity on SDUT Swap.</p></div>

