        <main class="guidelines-content">
            <section class="guidelines-intro">
                <span class="guidelines-kicker">THE COMMUNITY PROMISE</span>
                <h2>Make campus trading a positive experience.</h2>
                <p>Whether you are browsing, selling, or buying, your choices affect other students. A good community depends on clear communication, responsible behavior, and mutual respect.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="guideline-clause" id="respect"><span>01</span><div><h2>Respect every member</h2><p>Speak to other students with courtesy, even when you disagree or a transaction does not go as planned.</p><ul><li>Do not harass, threaten, bully, intimidate, or discriminate against anyone.</li><li>Avoid insults, hate speech, humiliating comments, and repeated unwanted contact.</li><li>Respect a person's decision to decline an offer or stop a conversation.</li><li>Do not impersonate students, staff, or university representatives.</li></ul></div></section>

            <section class="guideline-clause" id="honesty"><span>02</span><div><h2>Be honest and transparent</h2><p>Trust begins with accurate information. Be clear about what you are offering and what you expect from another user.</p><ul><li>Use truthful descriptions, prices, availability, and condition details.</li><li>Disclose defects, missing parts, repairs, or other issues that could affect a buyer's decision.</li><li>Use genuine photos of the actual item whenever possible; do not misrepresent an item with unrelated images.</li><li>Do not create fake listings, fake interest, false payment claims, or misleading reviews and messages.</li></ul></div></section>

            <section class="guideline-clause" id="listings"><span>03</span><div><h2>Publish responsible listings</h2><p>Every listing should help another student understand what is being offered without confusion or pressure.</p><ul><li>Choose an appropriate category and provide a useful title and description.</li><li>Set a clear and realistic price, and update or remove a listing when the item is no longer available.</li><li>Only list items you own or are authorized to sell.</li><li>Do not publish private information, spam, unrelated promotions, or content that violates another person's rights.</li><li>Never list stolen, counterfeit, illegal, dangerous, or otherwise prohibited items.</li></ul></div></section>

            <section class="guideline-clause" id="messages"><span>04</span><div><h2>Keep conversations constructive</h2><p>Use messages to ask relevant questions, clarify details, and agree on practical arrangements.</p><ul><li>Keep communication polite, clear, and related to the listing or transaction.</li><li>Do not send spam, deceptive links, suspicious attachments, or repeated unwanted messages.</li><li>Do not pressure, threaten, or manipulate another user into accepting an offer.</li><li>Be patient when someone needs time to respond. Do not assume immediate availability.</li><li>Keep relevant conversations on the platform where possible so there is a record if a concern needs to be reported.</li></ul></section>

            <section class="guideline-clause" id="trading"><span>05</span><div><h2>Trade fairly and responsibly</h2><p>Buyers and sellers are responsible for agreeing on the terms of their own exchange. Take reasonable steps to protect both sides.</p><ul><li>Agree on the price, item condition, payment method, and handover details before meeting.</li><li>Meet in a public, well-lit campus location and consider letting someone you trust know your plan.</li><li>Inspect the item before paying. Ask questions if something does not match the listing.</li><li>Sellers should verify that payment has actually arrived before handing over an item; do not rely only on screenshots or messages.</li><li>Do not demand advance payments through suspicious links, unexpected courier fees, or pressure tactics.</li><li>If an agreement changes, communicate clearly and promptly.</li></ul><p>For more practical advice, read the <a href="/safety">Safety Tips</a>.</p></div></section>

            <section class="guideline-clause" id="privacy"><span>06</span><div><h2>Protect privacy and account security</h2><p>Personal and account information should be shared carefully. A marketplace conversation should not require access to someone's private accounts or credentials.</p><ul><li>Never ask another user for a password, verification code, or account access.</li><li>Do not post bank details, identity documents, private addresses, or other sensitive information in public listings or chats.</li><li>Do not share another person's photos, contact details, messages, or personal information without permission.</li><li>Be cautious with links, payment requests, and anyone claiming to be platform support outside official channels.</li><li>Keep your login details private and report suspected account misuse.</li></ul></section>

            <section class="guideline-clause" id="prohibited"><span>07</span><div><h2>Behavior that is not allowed</h2><p>The following activities undermine the community and may lead to content removal or account restrictions:</p><ul><li>Fraud, scams, theft, counterfeit sales, or knowingly false claims.</li><li>Harassment, hate speech, threats, discrimination, or intimidation.</li><li>Listing illegal, stolen, dangerous, or restricted goods.</li><li>Spam, phishing, malicious links, malware, or attempts to collect private information.</li><li>Impersonation, unauthorized account access, or attempts to bypass platform safeguards.</li><li>Manipulating, disrupting, or abusing the platform or its community features.</li></ul></section>

            <section class="guideline-clause" id="reporting"><span>08</span><div><h2>Speak up when something is wrong</h2><p>If you encounter a suspicious listing, abusive message, or behavior that appears to violate these guidelines, report it through the available platform support options.</p><ul><li>Explain what happened clearly and include relevant listing or conversation details.</li><li>Share accurate evidence where available, but do not publish someone else's private information publicly.</li><li>Do not retaliate, threaten, or start a public argument. Disengage if you feel unsafe.</li><li>For immediate danger or suspected criminal activity, contact campus security or the appropriate local authorities. Do not rely only on an in-platform report.</li></ul><a class="guidelines-contact-link" href="/support">Visit the Support Center <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></section>

            <section class="guideline-clause" id="enforcement"><span>09</span><div><h2>How guidelines are enforced</h2><p>Reports and suspected violations may be reviewed by the platform team. Depending on the circumstances and seriousness of the issue, action may include removing or restricting a listing, limiting access to features, or suspending an account.</p><p>Attempts to evade restrictions or repeat harmful behavior may lead to further action. Not every report will result in the same outcome, and submitting a report does not guarantee a particular decision.</p></div></section>
